# ── SIGNALS (thresholds frozen; values are the latest reported quarter) ───────
# thresholds by rule T over the years the filings report (retro/README.md, AVGO; retro/facts/AVGO.json, rule_t): BULL = the
# median, XBULL = the best year, BASE = the worst year, BEAR = one median-to-worst step beyond the worst (the opex and inventory
# gaps, where lower is better, mirrored); four annual values (FY2005-FY2008), three for the inventory gap (FY2006-FY2008);
